target/
*.class
*.jar
# ...but the vendored SDK jar under lib/ is a build input, not a build output.
# CI and Render have no sibling SDK checkout and resolve it straight from here,
# so if it is not committed the image builds against nothing. It only ever got
# in via `git add -f`, which is a step the next person to bump the version has
# no reason to know about -- and the failure is a broken deploy, not a broken
# commit.
!lib/**/*.jar
jdk/
.DS_Store
